01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Grown Ups is a 2010 American comedy film directed by Dennis Dugan, written by Adam Sandler and Fred Wolf, produced by Sandler and Jack Giarraputo, and
starring Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade, and Rob Schneider, with Salma Hayek, Maria Bello, and Maya Rudolph in supporting roles.

11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
The film's plot tells the story of five lifelong friends who won their
junior high school basketball championship in 1978.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
They reunite three decades later for a 4th of July weekend after
learning about the death of their former coach.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Produced by Sandler's Happy Madison Productions in collaboration with Relativity Media, Grown
Ups was released in the United States on June 25, 2010, by Columbia Pictures.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Despite receiving negative reviews from critics, it grossed $272.2
million and led to a sequel, Grown Ups 2, in 2013.

